{title: Wind and Fire}
{subtitle: Acts 2:1–4; John 3:8}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 128}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [–] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [F#] |
| [C#] | [A#m] | [B] | [F#] |
| [C#] | [C#] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D#m]Like a rushing mighty [C#]wind [B]
Filling every room [F#][C#]
[D#m]Tongues of fire on every [C#]head
Spirit, fall on us [F#]too [C#]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[B]The wind blows where it [C#]wants to
[D#m]We hear it [F#]but don't know where it [B]goes
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[D#m]Come, Ho[F#]ly [C#]Spirit, come
[A#m]Wind and fire, fall [B]on us [F#][C#]
[D#m]Come, Ho[F#]ly [C#]Spirit, come
[A#m]Wind and fire, fall [B]on us
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [F#] | [C#] | [C#] | [D#m] |
| [F#] | [C#] | [A#m] | [B] |
| [F#] | [C#] | [C#] | [D#m] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
All of them [F#]were [C#]filled [A#m][B]
Speaking ev[F#]ery tongue [C#]
[D#m]Every nation hears [F#]his [C#]name
The [A#m]new day has [F#]begun [C#]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[B]The wind blows where it [C#]wants to
[D#m]We hear it [F#]but don't know where it [B]goes [D#m]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F#]Come, Ho[C#]ly Spirit, [A#m][B]come
Wind and [F#]fire, [C#]fall [D#m]on us
[F#]Come, Ho[C#]ly Spirit, [A#m]come
Wind and [B]fire, fall [F#]on [C#]us
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Interlude}
| [C#] | [C#] | [D#m] | [F#] | [C#] | [A#m] | [B] | [F#] | ×2
| [C#] | [C#] | [C#] |
